    {
      "source": "<a href=\"GeoJson.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.geo\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> representation of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Polygon.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Polygon</code></a>. Unlike <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Polygon.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Polygon</code></a> the <a href=\"GeoJsonPolygon.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.geo\"><code>GeoJsonPolygon</code></a> requires a\nclosed border. Which means that the first and last <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point</code></a> have to have same coordinate pairs.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"GeoJson.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.geo 中的接口\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> 格式的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Polygon.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Polygon</code></a>。与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Polygon.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Polygon</code></a> 不同，<a href=\"GeoJsonPolygon.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.geo 中的类\"><code>GeoJsonPolygon</code></a> 需要一个闭合的边界。这意味着第一个和最后一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point</code></a> 必须具有相同的坐标对。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The value of the coordinates member is always an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>. The structure for the elements within is\ndetermined by <a href=\"GeoJson.html#getType()\"><code>GeoJson.getType()</code></a> of geometry.",
      "translation": "坐标成员的值的类型始终为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>。其内部元素的由几何体的<a href=\"GeoJson.html#getType()\"><code>GeoJson.getType()</code></a>决定。",
      "count": 1
    },
